>> Animal := Into okusha.
>> Factory := Into okusha.

Animal uma-kufika: ['okusha'] yenza: {
	>> animal := uqobo okusha.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal uma-kufika: ['sound:'] yenza: { :s
	okwakho sound := s.
}.

Animal uma-kufika: ['sound'] yenza: { <- okwakho sound.
}.

>> Dog := Into okusha.
>> Cat := Into okusha.

Dog uma-kufika: ['okusha'] yenza: { <- Animal okusha sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat uma-kufika: ['okusha'] yenza: { <- Animal okusha sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Okuphumayo bhala: Dog okusha sound, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: Cat okusha sound, umugqa-omusha.

Factory uma-kufika: ['mix:and:'] yenza: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal okusha sound: (
		( beast1 sound kusuka: 0 ubude: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound kusuka: 2 ubude: 5 )
	).
}.

Okuphumayo bhala: (Factory mix: Dog okusha and: Cat okusha) sound, umugqa-omusha.
